WEBVTT

00:07.920 --> 00:10.400
Great Yan and Xiyan on the Central Plains

00:10.480 --> 00:12.240
have been at war for many years.

00:12.320 --> 00:15.000
After the Weibei Army reclaimed Qingzhou,

00:15.080 --> 00:16.200
which was lost territory of Great Yan,

00:16.280 --> 00:18.720
they ordered a fire
and massacre of the city.

00:18.800 --> 00:20.600
Mei Lin!

00:22.640 --> 00:25.760
Wake up! Fire! It's on fire!

00:25.840 --> 00:26.880
Hurry.

00:26.960 --> 00:28.160
Get up.

00:28.240 --> 00:30.240
Father. If I go down, what about you?

00:30.320 --> 00:32.600
Good girl. You go down first.

00:34.160 --> 00:35.320
Don't worry.

00:37.840 --> 00:40.160
It's okay. I'm holding the rope.

00:40.240 --> 00:41.920
Mei, hold tightly.

00:43.280 --> 00:44.840
Mei, hold tightly!

00:51.240 --> 00:52.800
- Father!
- Mei!

00:54.360 --> 00:56.360
Father!

00:58.800 --> 00:59.840
Father!

01:02.400 --> 01:06.560
You… You must survive!

01:12.920 --> 01:15.560
Father!

01:46.720 --> 01:48.400
Stop!

01:48.480 --> 01:49.760
Don't fuel the flames!

01:51.840 --> 01:52.720
Who are you?

01:52.800 --> 01:54.280
Why did you set the fire?

01:54.360 --> 01:56.600
- Who on earth are you?
- Step aside!

02:02.760 --> 02:03.720
WEIBEI

02:03.800 --> 02:06.400
Weibei Army. Murong Jinghe.

02:06.920 --> 02:09.000
Blood for blood!

03:50.240 --> 03:54.760
My parents died in the fire ten years ago.

03:54.840 --> 03:56.640
Mei Lin from Qingzhou
was also burnt to death.

04:08.360 --> 04:09.760
I forgot how to cry.

04:12.800 --> 04:14.160
I forgot how to feel pain.

04:15.960 --> 04:18.120
I've been trained in the Shadow Works
for many years.

04:20.440 --> 04:23.280
My only purpose is to kill Murong Jinghe
with my own hands.

05:52.920 --> 05:54.160
Mei Lin, what are you doing?

05:54.240 --> 05:55.760
We are ordered to find living persons

05:55.840 --> 05:56.920
and bring them back
to the Shadow Works for training.

05:57.000 --> 05:58.160
It wasn't easy to find one.

05:58.240 --> 05:59.240
Yet you killed her.

05:59.320 --> 06:01.280
This one was dying.

06:01.800 --> 06:02.920
That's not a living person.

06:03.000 --> 06:04.120
Why waste food and water on her?

06:04.200 --> 06:05.840
I'll report to the Master myself.

06:16.280 --> 06:18.000
Live on well.

06:34.440 --> 06:35.840
Greetings, Master.

06:36.480 --> 06:39.000
MASTER OF THE SHADOW WORKS

06:39.080 --> 06:42.600
MEI LIN, AN ORPHAN OF QINGZHOU
AND AN ASSASSIN OF THE SHADOW WORKS

06:45.160 --> 06:46.600
This is a gift for you.

06:57.000 --> 06:58.480
Complete the task

06:58.560 --> 07:00.920
to get the antidote.

07:01.000 --> 07:02.640
Only then can you

07:02.720 --> 07:04.920
leave the Shadow Works.

07:05.000 --> 07:06.000
Thank you, Master.

07:06.080 --> 07:09.120
Infiltrate the peace-making
marriage delegation of Xiyan

07:09.640 --> 07:12.520
and assassinate
the third prince of Great Yan,

07:12.600 --> 07:14.800
Murong Jinghe.

07:14.880 --> 07:16.040
Weibei Army.

07:16.120 --> 07:17.960
Murong Jinghe.

07:18.040 --> 07:19.720
Blood for blood!

07:20.760 --> 07:21.800
Remember,

07:21.880 --> 07:25.840
the alliance banquet is your only chance.

07:39.640 --> 07:41.320
In the 25th year of the Zhaoming era,

07:41.400 --> 07:44.600
Great Yan and Xiyan agreed to a truce
after a century of confrontation.

07:44.680 --> 07:46.400
The King of Xiyan sent Princess Zigu

07:46.480 --> 07:49.600
and 100 Beauties to Great Yan
to form a marriage alliance.

07:49.680 --> 07:53.160
The marriage delegation of Xiyan
will enter Great Yan from Jingbei.

07:53.240 --> 07:56.000
Murong Jinghe, the third prince,
stationed in Jingbei,

07:56.080 --> 07:57.800
volunteered to be the wedding envoy.

07:57.880 --> 07:58.800
YANMING PALACE

07:58.880 --> 08:00.840
Greetings, Father.

08:12.160 --> 08:14.120
These are all the memorials
opposing Jinghe

08:14.200 --> 08:16.120
serving as the wedding envoy.

08:16.840 --> 08:19.240
Xuanlie, what do you think?

08:19.800 --> 08:20.640
Father.

08:20.720 --> 08:22.320
MURONG XUANLIE
THE CROWN PRINCE OF GREAT YAN

08:22.400 --> 08:24.240
This third brother of mine
was excessively violent

08:24.320 --> 08:25.160
in his past expeditions against Xiyan.

08:25.760 --> 08:26.600
The marriage alliance marks

08:26.680 --> 08:28.080
the beginning of friendly relations
between the two countries.

08:28.600 --> 08:30.680
If General Weibei serves
as the wedding envoy,

08:30.760 --> 08:31.880
it will inevitably create new tensions.

08:32.960 --> 08:36.960
It's understandable
that the officials have doubts.

08:37.480 --> 08:41.760
Do you also think Jinghe
is not a good choice?

08:45.160 --> 08:46.840
MURONG QIAN
THE EMPEROR OF GREAT YAN

08:48.360 --> 08:49.600
That's not what I think.

08:49.680 --> 08:51.800
Xiyan and Great Yan have been at war
for many years.

08:51.880 --> 08:53.160
Agreeing to this marriage alliance

08:53.240 --> 08:54.680
indicates that they can
no longer afford to fight.

08:54.760 --> 08:57.440
If they plan to use the marriage alliance
to lie in wait,

08:57.520 --> 08:59.720
General Weibei Murong Jinghe

08:59.800 --> 09:02.200
is the ideal choice to deter Xiyan.

09:05.200 --> 09:07.560
In recent years, Jinghe has become

09:08.120 --> 09:10.080
increasingly reckless and unruly
in Jingbei.

09:10.800 --> 09:12.000
I'm still worried.

09:12.600 --> 09:14.400
After the great fire in Qingzhou,

09:14.480 --> 09:15.720
Jinghe was physically injured,

09:16.240 --> 09:17.280
which led to his current despondency.

09:21.400 --> 09:23.240
It's just matters of wine and women.

09:23.320 --> 09:24.240
Father, you don't need to worry.

09:24.920 --> 09:26.280
For so many years, he has not involved
himself in state affairs,

09:26.360 --> 09:28.720
but this time, he volunteered
to serve as the wedding envoy.

09:29.480 --> 09:31.120
I believe he has come to his senses

09:31.200 --> 09:33.000
and will surely share the burdens
and alleviate the worries

09:33.080 --> 09:35.400
for our Great Yan
and for you in the future.

09:36.040 --> 09:37.320
It's rare

09:37.960 --> 09:39.760
that you still think of him constantly.

09:43.000 --> 09:44.920
Ten years of self-reflection

09:46.640 --> 09:48.200
should be enough.

09:58.960 --> 10:00.240
We are about to arrive in Jingbei.

10:01.560 --> 10:04.760
I heard the wedding envoy Prince Jing
was the most favored prince.

10:04.840 --> 10:07.000
Prince Jing's Mansion is a good place.

10:07.080 --> 10:08.400
The information you gathered
is incomplete.

10:08.480 --> 10:10.040
He is a general who has fought
on the battlefield.

10:10.120 --> 10:11.240
He is very blood-thirsty and ruthless.

10:12.560 --> 10:15.720
I heard that his pillows and bed
were made from the bones of captives.

10:15.800 --> 10:17.800
No woman who has served him these years

10:17.880 --> 10:19.240
has lived to see the next day.

10:19.320 --> 10:20.800
We are peace-making Beauties,

10:21.520 --> 10:22.600
not captives.

10:22.680 --> 10:23.680
YI - DAI

10:23.760 --> 10:24.600
Don't be afraid of him.

10:25.520 --> 10:27.680
He wouldn't hesitate to kill
their own Great Yan citizens.

10:27.760 --> 10:29.120
What more would he do to us?

10:29.720 --> 10:31.880
You know what they call him in Great Yan?

10:31.960 --> 10:33.680
The mass murderer general!

10:33.760 --> 10:35.800
He once set a fire
that razed an entire city,

10:35.880 --> 10:38.600
burning over 100,000 people
in Qingzhou to ashes.

10:50.960 --> 10:52.520
Why is there no one receiving us?

10:53.440 --> 10:54.560
Why are the gates still closed?

10:55.600 --> 10:56.800
What is this?

10:56.880 --> 10:58.240
Why are the gates still closed?

11:01.200 --> 11:04.600
ZIGU, THE PRINCESS OF XIYAN

11:07.800 --> 11:09.960
This is paper money used in Great Yan
for sending the dead on their way.

11:17.200 --> 11:19.480
JINGBEI

11:38.000 --> 11:39.480
Turns out he's disabled.

11:39.560 --> 11:40.920
I think he is crazy.

11:41.000 --> 11:43.280
What does he want to do?

12:16.240 --> 12:17.520
Prince Jing?

12:19.520 --> 12:24.360
MURONG JINGHE
THE THIRD PRINCE OF GREAT YAN

12:29.640 --> 12:30.640
Your Highness.

12:32.440 --> 12:34.000
What does Prince Jing mean by this?

12:37.560 --> 12:40.480
Qi has accompanied me for many years.

12:40.560 --> 12:42.120
But he suddenly passed away.

12:42.760 --> 12:44.760
I am overwhelmed with grief.

12:45.320 --> 12:47.360
Only by scattering paper money
as an offering

12:48.280 --> 12:49.720
can I express my sorrow.

12:50.760 --> 12:51.640
Your Highness,

12:51.720 --> 12:53.720
His Highness has just lost his old friend

12:53.800 --> 12:55.400
and is extremely sad.

12:55.480 --> 12:58.480
Please forgive us
if we have been rude in any way.

13:01.320 --> 13:02.840
Who is Qi?

13:02.920 --> 13:03.760
QINGYAN

13:03.840 --> 13:06.160
- Qi was Prince Jing's turtle.
- You…

13:12.640 --> 13:14.400
How dare you call us turtles?

13:18.480 --> 13:20.320
I'm merely paying respects
to an old friend.

13:21.240 --> 13:22.760
You're overthinking it.

13:29.720 --> 13:31.000
Well…

13:52.440 --> 13:54.360
It seems my Ba

13:54.440 --> 13:56.840
has quite a connection with you.

13:58.160 --> 13:59.080
What do you want to do?

13:59.680 --> 14:01.640
I will do

14:02.520 --> 14:04.280
whatever you will do in Great Yan.

14:20.600 --> 14:21.560
My lord.

14:21.640 --> 14:23.800
After entering the capital, the Beauties
go through a grand selection

14:23.880 --> 14:25.000
before being assigned

14:25.080 --> 14:28.840
to the mansions of the imperial family
and high-ranking officials.

14:28.920 --> 14:30.880
How many can I have?

14:30.960 --> 14:32.480
Imperial relatives can have four.

14:33.160 --> 14:34.160
Four.

14:35.560 --> 14:38.240
After much deliberation,

14:38.320 --> 14:41.120
this particular Beauty is the only one
who catches my fancy.

14:42.200 --> 14:43.920
Yet if I choose only one,

14:44.000 --> 14:45.320
it will seem like a loss for me.

14:46.680 --> 14:48.000
Well,

14:48.080 --> 14:49.640
as for the remaining three…

14:53.400 --> 14:55.040
Ba will pick for me.

14:56.200 --> 15:00.200
- My lord…
- Didn't you say I could pick four?

15:00.840 --> 15:02.120
According to protocol,

15:02.200 --> 15:05.000
a grand ceremony must occur
before selecting the Beauties.

15:08.320 --> 15:12.480
Then what's the use of me
being the wedding envoy?

15:12.560 --> 15:13.640
Enough!

15:13.720 --> 15:16.280
They are peace-making Beauties,
not captives.

15:16.360 --> 15:17.320
You have no right to insult them.

15:28.880 --> 15:32.640
Exchanging 100 peace-making Beauties
for 10,000 captives

15:33.400 --> 15:34.600
to return to Xiyan

15:34.680 --> 15:37.360
was a proposal initiated by your side.

15:38.160 --> 15:40.640
I merely went along with it.

15:40.720 --> 15:42.480
How can this be considered an insult?

15:44.400 --> 15:45.640
If you want to blame someone,

15:45.720 --> 15:48.520
blame your father.

16:03.800 --> 16:05.080
Your Highness,

16:05.160 --> 16:08.720
Prince Jing was joking just now.

16:08.800 --> 16:10.360
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

16:10.440 --> 16:12.680
In Great Yan, etiquette is highly valued.

16:12.760 --> 16:15.360
The peace-making Beauties
will absolutely not be summoned

16:15.440 --> 16:17.880
before the grand ceremony takes place.

16:20.320 --> 16:22.440
The Beauties are not yet accustomed
to the new environment.

16:22.520 --> 16:23.680
Let them enter the capital
to rest and adjust.

16:23.760 --> 16:24.760
That won't do.

16:25.720 --> 16:29.360
I need to wait
until Qi's seventh-day memorial is over.

16:29.440 --> 16:31.520
Prince Jing is joking again.

16:31.600 --> 16:34.120
His Majesty, understanding
your weary travels,

16:34.200 --> 16:37.240
has granted a special decree for you
to rest and recuperate in Jingbei

16:37.320 --> 16:38.720
before proceeding to the capital.

16:42.480 --> 16:43.440
JINGBEI RELAY STATION

16:43.520 --> 16:44.920
Riding in the carriage for so long

16:45.000 --> 16:46.320
- is really tiring.
- Please come in, miss.

16:46.400 --> 16:47.280
When can we depart for Zhaojing?

16:47.360 --> 16:49.160
This is so beautiful.

16:49.240 --> 16:50.720
I hope we can arrive in Zhaojing soon.

16:52.440 --> 16:53.280
There is food.

16:54.360 --> 16:56.360
I noticed you haven't eaten anything
in the evening.

16:56.440 --> 16:57.400
So, I fetched some Dengguo Cakes

16:57.480 --> 16:59.880
from the kitchen,
just in case you're hungry.

16:59.960 --> 17:00.960
Try them.

17:01.040 --> 17:02.160
Dengguo Cakes?

17:05.720 --> 17:07.319
Mei Lin, come and eat.

17:09.560 --> 17:10.880
It's so sour.

17:12.839 --> 17:14.119
So sour.

17:14.200 --> 17:17.119
Dengguo Cakes made
by Qingzhou people are the tastiest.

17:17.200 --> 17:18.800
I wonder what secret ingredient
they put in.

17:18.880 --> 17:20.040
You can't even taste the sourness
of Dengguo in them.

17:20.119 --> 17:21.000
Mountain licorice.

17:21.079 --> 17:22.560
Is the cake no longer sour
after adding mountain licorice?

17:31.440 --> 17:32.600
There is someone outside the room.

17:40.080 --> 17:42.400
I can't fall asleep.

17:42.480 --> 17:43.440
Your Highness,

17:43.520 --> 17:45.360
this is a leather pendant
my mother made for me.

17:45.440 --> 17:47.360
Placing it under the pillow
can help you sleep peacefully.

17:47.440 --> 17:48.640
It's useless.

17:48.720 --> 17:51.280
Here are all things from Xiyan.

17:51.360 --> 17:52.600
Bamboo tube wine can help with sleep.

17:52.680 --> 17:53.920
Why not give it a try?

17:54.520 --> 17:56.720
I can't sleep when I'm too full.

17:57.520 --> 17:59.120
Shall we jump with Your Highness?

17:59.200 --> 18:01.040
- You'll fall asleep when you are tired.
- Right.

18:02.320 --> 18:04.040
That sounds very unreliable.

18:05.800 --> 18:07.920
Is there any way to fall asleep right away

18:08.000 --> 18:10.680
without having to exert myself?

18:11.640 --> 18:12.480
Knock Your Highness out.

18:17.080 --> 18:19.480
First, apply pressure to the shoulders
and neck to numb the meridians.

18:19.560 --> 18:21.000
Then guide the force to the Fengchi point.

18:21.080 --> 18:22.480
With a precise application of strength
to the wrist, deliver a single strike

18:22.560 --> 18:23.520
that causes immediate unconsciousness
without pain,

18:23.600 --> 18:25.880
ensuring at least 12 hours of sleep.

18:27.320 --> 18:29.440
Mei Lin, are you serious?

18:29.520 --> 18:32.120
If Her Highness gets hurt,
could you bear the responsibility?

18:32.200 --> 18:33.720
Mei Lin must be joking.

18:34.400 --> 18:35.640
Mei Lin,

18:35.720 --> 18:38.120
if you have the confidence,
I may give it a try.

18:43.840 --> 18:45.240
- Your Highness, please don't!
- Your Highness, please don't!

18:48.320 --> 18:50.920
This is a method I heard about
from a wandering doctor when I was little.

18:51.000 --> 18:52.320
I've never tried it before,

18:52.400 --> 18:53.240
but I am confident it will work.

19:04.920 --> 19:07.040
Your Highness said you were afraid.

19:08.480 --> 19:09.920
Why?

19:10.000 --> 19:11.880
If anyone in Great Yan dares
to bully Your Highness,

19:11.960 --> 19:13.760
His Majesty won't let them off the hook.

19:17.840 --> 19:19.600
That lunatic was right.

19:21.720 --> 19:24.640
My father sold me to Great Yan.

19:24.720 --> 19:25.760
He wants nothing to do with me.

19:25.840 --> 19:27.640
Don't believe the lunatic's words.

19:27.720 --> 19:29.240
Your Highness is smart and cute.

19:29.320 --> 19:30.840
Everyone will like Your Highness.

19:34.240 --> 19:35.920
But there are so many princesses
in the palace.

19:36.000 --> 19:38.600
Ziyu, the Queen's daughter,
is totally the better match.

19:38.680 --> 19:39.760
My father just can't part with her.

19:39.840 --> 19:42.240
He designated me for the marriage alliance

19:42.320 --> 19:43.600
just because…

19:50.280 --> 19:51.520
Because Your Highness are…

19:57.240 --> 19:58.080
the prettiest.

19:59.280 --> 20:01.400
Right. I am the prettiest.

20:05.680 --> 20:07.280
Mei Lin, do you feel afraid?

20:08.600 --> 20:10.200
There is nothing to be afraid of
in this world.

20:11.760 --> 20:12.800
Right.

20:13.680 --> 20:15.400
I've come to Great Yan to see my brother.

20:15.480 --> 20:17.720
I have to be fine
so as not to make my brother worry.

20:18.640 --> 20:19.480
There is nothing to be afraid of.

20:20.200 --> 20:21.160
Time to sleep.

20:29.000 --> 20:32.360
JINGBEI MANSION

20:32.960 --> 20:34.200
It's him who set the fire.

20:34.280 --> 20:36.760
- You caused their death.
- Why did you set the fire?

22:03.520 --> 22:05.200
Minor tricks.

22:33.640 --> 22:35.440
Well, sly foxes never play the fool.

23:05.320 --> 23:07.520
So many people want to kill you.

23:08.960 --> 23:10.880
But I'm the one who'll actually do it.

23:12.360 --> 23:13.800
Let me repeat the rules.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.920
Prince Jing prefers to bathe alone
without anyone serving him.

23:16.440 --> 23:18.680
Leave immediately
after delivering the herbs.

23:18.760 --> 23:19.680
Yes.

23:22.760 --> 23:24.400
Why is he soaking
in the medicinal spring again?

23:24.920 --> 23:26.680
Has His Highness' old illness flared up?

23:45.920 --> 23:47.080
Miss,

23:48.840 --> 23:50.160
it's you.

23:52.120 --> 23:53.040
My lord,

23:53.560 --> 23:55.240
I, Mei Lin, have brought you the herbs.

23:56.000 --> 23:57.320
Mei Lin.

23:59.520 --> 24:02.240
Having you serve as my medicine attendant

24:02.760 --> 24:04.120
is unfair to you.

24:08.080 --> 24:10.080
I don't just want to be
a medicine attendant.

24:40.160 --> 24:42.320
Seeing your demeanor today,

24:44.000 --> 24:45.400
I have developed an admiration for you.

24:47.440 --> 24:48.880
I hope you can accept me.

24:52.280 --> 24:54.640
You recommend yourself to be my woman.

24:55.680 --> 24:56.560
I…

24:58.080 --> 24:59.000
am very happy with this.

25:28.320 --> 25:30.400
Oh no. There is Muscle-Softening Powder
in the water.

25:37.160 --> 25:39.200
You expressed your love boldly.

25:40.360 --> 25:42.480
What do you want on earth?

25:44.960 --> 25:47.600
If you want my life,

25:49.520 --> 25:51.920
I can't afford to give it to you.

25:53.160 --> 25:54.640
I just want you.

25:58.760 --> 25:59.880
Bleeding

26:00.600 --> 26:04.120
should be on the wedding night
in Zhaojing.

26:05.000 --> 26:06.440
What do you think?

26:18.240 --> 26:19.840
I can't wait so long,

26:21.520 --> 26:22.880
and I don't want to.

26:26.840 --> 26:29.080
No matter what you want,

26:29.600 --> 26:34.680
such eagerness will bring you trouble.

26:41.120 --> 26:42.840
Assassin!

26:42.920 --> 26:44.000
Catch the assassin!

26:44.080 --> 26:45.560
Catch the assassin!

26:45.640 --> 26:48.160
Assassin! Protect Prince Jing!

26:48.680 --> 26:49.640
Catch the assassin!

26:50.280 --> 26:52.160
Where is Prince Jing? Protect Prince Jing!

26:52.240 --> 26:54.760
Hurry! Go to the medicinal spring.

27:11.520 --> 27:13.560
- My lord. My lord, there is an assassin.
- There is an assassin.

27:13.640 --> 27:15.080
My lord, there is…

27:22.640 --> 27:23.880
Go.

27:44.480 --> 27:47.400
Everyone sees me as a lunatic.

27:50.120 --> 27:51.320
A lunatic

27:52.120 --> 27:55.240
can do anything.

28:02.280 --> 28:04.840
I can fulfill your desire here.

28:06.920 --> 28:09.520
Of course, I can also…

28:12.600 --> 28:14.040
kill you here.

28:16.720 --> 28:17.720
So,

28:19.360 --> 28:22.960
don't irritate a lunatic.

28:35.440 --> 28:36.840
I'm not afraid of death.

28:38.840 --> 28:42.440
I'm just afraid I can't die with you.

28:59.640 --> 29:01.480
Your eyes…

29:03.400 --> 29:05.680
are truly unique.

29:08.320 --> 29:10.360
Have we met before?

29:14.840 --> 29:16.120
Perhaps…

29:18.200 --> 29:20.040
we met in our past lives.

29:21.320 --> 29:23.520
You and I

29:23.600 --> 29:27.640
are definitely meant
to be together by destiny.

29:30.680 --> 29:32.240
